WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.571
Long before cities,

2
00:00:01.571 --> 00:00:03.380
people painted on rock walls

3
00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:04.783
in central India.

4
00:00:04.783 --> 00:00:06.353
And farmed at Mehrgarh,

5
00:00:06.353 --> 00:00:08.184
