6
00:00:08.509 --> 00:00:10.397
The rock shelters of Bhimbetka

7
00:00:10.397 --> 00:00:12.510
hold paintings from the Mesolithic

8
00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:14.931
onwards. They became a World

9
00:00:14.931 --> 00:00:17.247
Heritage Site in 2003.

10
00:00:17.579 --> 00:00:19.124
Mehrgarh shows some of the

11
00:00:19.124 --> 00:00:20.930
earliest farming and herding in

12
00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:22.029
South Asia,

13
00:00:22.029 --> 00:00:24.856
from about 7000 BCE.

14
00:00:25.193 --> 00:00:26.271
The Palaeolithic,

15
00:00:26.271 --> 00:00:27.746
